# Four and Five Island (FireRed's MUS_SEVII_45, which the two islands share): an easy-going tune in G major, an
# ocarina over a harp's rippling chords, a soft string pad and a walking bass, for an island of snow and dolls and one
# of quiet meadows. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K9, part b).
